# ScamShield — storage/.htaccess
# CRITICAL: This directory contains private files that must NEVER be
# directly accessible via HTTP:
#   storage/evidence/  — uploaded evidence files (contain user data)
#   storage/vt_cache/  — VirusTotal API response cache (JSON)
#   storage/logs/      — application and PHP error logs
#
# PHP can still read/write here (open_basedir allows htdocs/).
# Direct HTTP requests to any file in this tree are denied.

Require all denied
